hyperactive-interaction-in-the-words-of-the-human-superorganism-lines-3 : List (List Word)
hyperactive-interaction-in-the-words-of-the-human-superorganism-lines-3 = cons "The word that names what conformity does is *norm*. *Norma* in Latin is the carpenter's square, the tool for making right angles. The normal is what has been squared. The abnormal is not wrong; it is only not at right angles to the carpenter's tool. Clinical psychiatry took a carpenter's instrument and turned it on minds." (cons "" nil)
